t,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">菲尔兹奖得主雅各布·齐默尔曼官宣加入OpenAI投身AI安全研究</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯合并混元多模态与大语言模型部门，由首席AI科学家姚顺雨统管</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google第二季度资本开支翻倍至449亿美元，云业务运营利润率升至35.6%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">黑森林实验室发布FLUX3多模态基础模型，支持20秒音视频同步生成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dbf511116b0653d1158ca75dacce62e6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Black Forest Labs正式推出FLUX3多模态基础模型，该模型采用统一架构，基于Self-Flow自监督流匹配框架，实现了图像、视频与音频的联合训练。FLUX3支持单次生成最长20秒的视频并附带原生音频，具备文生视频、图生视频、视频续写及多镜头串联等多种创作模式。在人工评测中，FLUX3在10秒720p视频生成任务中表现优异，对比Grok Imagine Video胜率达69%，对比Seedance 2.0和Gemini Omni Flash胜率均为52%。除内容生成外，FLUX3还具备图像编辑与多语言对话能力。目前，Black Forest Labs正与Mimic Robotics合作，探索将FLUX3应用于机器人行为预测，旨在将多模态AI能力从数字创作延伸至实体机器人领域，打造连接数字与物理世界</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴开源0.8B参数文档解析模型OvisOCR2，登顶OmniDocBench基准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/cb30ff938973a12cf696bd77d1ded8b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月24日，阿里巴巴正式开源0.8B参数规模的文档解析模型OvisOCR2。该模型在OmniDocBench v1.6基准测试中以96.58分登顶，成为首个超越传统流水线方法的端到端文档解析模型。OvisOCR2基于Qwen3.5-0.8B后训练，通过SFT、RL、在线策略蒸馏（OPD）及模型融合技术，实现单模型一次生成包含文本、公式、表格与视觉区域的Markdown输出。相比传统“版面分析+内容识别”的复杂流水线，OvisOCR2显著降低了部署成本与误差累积。目前该模型已基于Apache 2.0协议在Hugging Face及魔搭社区开源，兼容vLLM推理框架，支持无缝接入千问生态。其小参数、高性能的特性大幅降低了高精度文档解析的显存与算力门槛，推动文档智能技术向模型驱动的简洁范式演进，对RAG检索、智能问答</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">菲尔兹奖得主雅各布·齐默尔曼官宣加入OpenAI投身AI安全研究</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/730c66fd8008a8495148a3d15a35b002.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2026年国际数学家大会揭晓菲尔兹奖，加拿大数学家雅各布·齐默尔曼（Jacob Zimmerman）在获奖后宣布，将转向AI安全领域并正式加入OpenAI。齐默尔曼此前因将o-极小性理论重塑为算术几何与复代数几何工具，并证明格里菲斯周期图像代数性猜想及安德烈-奥尔特猜想而获此殊荣。OpenAI首席研究官马克·陈及研究员布贝克均确认该消息，并高度评价其数学天赋及对AI安全议题的审慎思考。齐默尔曼出生于1988年，曾两度摘得IMO金牌，师从数论名家彼得·萨纳克，自2014年起任教于多伦多大学。此次顶尖数学家跨界投身AI安全，标志着AI安全治理领域对学术界顶尖人才的吸引力显著增强，行业对AI系统底层逻辑与安全性的关注度正进一步提升。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯合并混元多模态与大语言模型部门，由首席AI科学家姚顺雨统管</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f427fa5c2d92a15cc77ab1b6b6a1c035.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯于7月23日正式宣布重组AI研发架构，将混元多模态模型部门与大语言模型部门合并，新设基础模型部，由腾讯首席AI科学家姚顺雨统一管理。此次架构调整旨在打破多模态与语言模型间的研发壁垒，提升模型研发协同效率，通过统一的指挥中枢加速全模态模型的迭代与智能上限探索。姚顺雨此前已于去年12月兼任大语言模型部负责人，此次整合意味着腾讯将进一步强化混元模型在视觉理解与自然语言处理能力的深度融合，推动技术路线向全模态方向全面演进。这一举措标志着腾讯在基础模型领域进入资源整合与技术攻坚的新阶段，旨在通过统一的技术栈与研发体系，提升混元模型在复杂任务中的综合表现。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google第二季度资本开支翻倍至449亿美元，云业务运营利润率升至35.6%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94144b689fb240822bd21f2db8ddc42c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Alphabet发布2026年第二季度财报，资本支出同比暴涨100%至创纪录的449.2亿美元，主要投向AI基础设施建设。得益于AI需求激增，Google Cloud营收同比增长82%达248亿美元，运营利润率从此前水平大幅提升至35.6%，积压订单规模达5140亿美元。在模型应用方面，Gemini月活用户已达9.5亿，其模型API每分钟处理的token量高达220亿。谷歌通过云业务的高增长与利润率扩张，支撑了其在AI基建领域的持续高额投入。行业分析指出，超大规模云服务商的资本支出正处于高速增长周期，预计到2027年全球相关支出将突破万亿美元大关，AI基础设施正迎来重构。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
